WEBVTT

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:07.750
Say, did any of ya get to go on holiday with your families this year?

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:08.950
Nope.

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:10.220
I didn't!

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:11.990
I'm afraid I was unable to as well.

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:15.890
With a family as big as mine, trips like that just aren't practical.

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:19.360
Yeah, we've got the shop to run, so we're kinda stuck at home too.

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:23.430
I'd love to go abroad at least once!

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:30.800
Wait, we have the Wonder Library! We can go anywhere in the world we want!

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:36.880
I'd love to visit a real castle, like in a fairytale!

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:43.350
I wanna run through the steppes of Mongolia, and then sample all the gourmet delights the world has to offer!

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:50.190
Sounds good! There was this program on TV I saw showin' all this awesome food Taiwan has!

00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:54.430
Personally, I would love to see the Great Wall of China with my own two eyes.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:57.900
And I really wanna see the Statue of Liberty!

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:01.040
Why don't we go see them all-kuru?

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.220
<i>All</i> of them?!

00:01:06.910 --> 00:01:08.480
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:10.320
Smile Precure!

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:11.220
Let's go!

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:12.750
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:13.890
All together!

00:01:14.120 --> 00:01:15.490
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:17.690
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:20.360
Smile Precure!

00:01:22.230 --> 00:01:25.200
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:30.640
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:31.010 --> 00:01:35.840
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:36.580 --> 00:01:41.780
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:46.720
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:46.690
So bright!

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:51.890
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:58.330
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:58.830
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:00.000
Let's go!

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.700
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:05.640
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:10.440
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:11.010
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:12.680
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:13.810
Everybody!

00:02:13.850 --> 00:02:15.480
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:18.020
Fly to the future!

00:02:18.350 --> 00:02:21.520
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:23.690
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:23.690 --> 00:02:25.990
Smile Precure!

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:36.870
They've almost collected all the Décors...

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:42.200
I need to put a stop to these Precures...

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:47.640
...whatever it takes.

00:02:58.430 --> 00:03:00.170
Right then, let's set off!

00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:02.120
Okay!

00:03:17.870 --> 00:03:21.440
Whoa! We're actually here!

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:23.580
This is the Château de Versailles, in France!

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:33.530
I feel like an actual princess!

00:03:33.890 --> 00:03:36.190
Miyuki, use the Dress Décor-kuru!

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:41.340
Let's Go: Dress!

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:44.400
You may call me Princess Candy-kuru!

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:46.890
How cute!

00:03:47.970 --> 00:03:50.490
I wish I could live in a castle like this...

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:53.280
Must be a pain cleanin' a place this big, though.

00:03:53.880 --> 00:04:00.310
This palace was the home of Marie Antoinette, and is hence quite a famous landmark.

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:11.290
These macarons are really good!

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:13.390
Alright, here goes!

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:16.260
Come on, quickly!

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:17.700
Say "Peace"!

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:21.740
Alright, what's our next stop?

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:26.010
We're really here in Taiwan!

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:33.080
Specifically, in Jiufen. To my knowledge, it is a rather bustling town that rose up during the gold rush.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:37.820
We should come here more often, and try out all the delicious food!

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:40.190
This is really good!

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:46.260
I wish we could open a place here, and get everyone eatin' some good old Japanese okonomiyaki!

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:53.340
Excuse me! Another bowl please!

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:55.350
How much are you gonna eat?!

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:57.290
Alright, get ready!

00:04:58.440 --> 00:04:59.810
Say "Peace"!

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:00.610
Yay!

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:12.420
<i>Mongolia, here we are!</i>

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.310
You doin' your bullet train impression?

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:20.530
I've never seen such wide open space before!

00:05:20.990 --> 00:05:25.680
I could roll around here forever... it's so comfy!

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:27.200
Really comfy!

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:34.180
The people here live a nomadic lifestyle along with their cows, sheep and horses.

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:35.950
Say "Peace"!

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:43.550
This is the famous Great Wall of China.

00:05:43.550 --> 00:05:47.120
Wow! It's so long!

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:54.640
The imposing structure of the Great Wall was constructed to fend off potential invasions by...

00:05:56.040 --> 00:06:00.410
Where did you buy that?! And how are you still hungry?!

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:02.900
All that running worked up quite an appetite!

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:04.340
Yeah, you were runnin' a lot...

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.310
Shall we make the ascent, then?

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:13.220
All great journeys begin with a single step. It's time we too stepped unto greatness.

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:17.570
Yeah, but wouldn't it be easier to just go that way instead?

00:06:18.970 --> 00:06:25.050
I believe we shall appreciate the view even more after the arduous climb to the top.

00:06:26.130 --> 00:06:27.530
Guess that makes sense!

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:31.970
Alright then, time to run off that food and get ready for my next meal!

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:33.890
She's really excited for all this food, ain't she?

00:06:33.890 --> 00:06:36.440
So, where next?

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:40.080
Hello, New York!

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:42.950
Oh, I've heard of this!

00:06:42.950 --> 00:06:44.430
Who's that lady?

00:06:44.430 --> 00:06:45.980
This is the Statue of Liberty.

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:50.820
It was a present from France to mark the hundredth anniversary of America's independence.

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:54.260
These hotdogs are really good!

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:55.820
Ain't they, Nao?

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:59.360
Wait, weren't you gettin' the same as me?!

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:00.630
Nah, I'm on my second of these.

00:07:00.630 --> 00:07:02.670
Where do ya put it all?

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:05.060
I'm hungry again after climbing that wall!

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:06.570
That's one heck of a metabolism...

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:09.040
How inspiring...

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:11.680
What is, Yayoi?

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:18.280
Well, see... you know that hero I like, Solarman? He defeated his enemies here with his Solar Flash!

00:07:18.770 --> 00:07:20.770
Like this!

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:26.620
I am the Hero of Justice, Solarman!

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:29.350
There you are, vile criminal!

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:33.030
Solar Flash!

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:40.830
<i>T-Thank you very much.</i>

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:44.050
We came all the way to America for you to do that?

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:47.300
Alright, here goes!

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:51.570
Pose, everyone!

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:13.770
Joker, what did you call me for-oni?

00:08:13.770 --> 00:08:18.540
Ah, Akaoni-san. Would you mind telling me how many times you've fought the Precure thus far?

00:08:20.480 --> 00:08:23.810
One, two, three, four, five...

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:27.250
...six, seven, eight, nine, ten...

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:30.950
Hey, Joker, lend me some fingers-oni!

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:37.760
You've fought them all those times and still never won? Rather embarrassing, don't you think?

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:39.790
I don't think you're really giving due thought...

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:44.930
...to the fact that Pierrot-sama will not put up with your incompetence forever.

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:48.800
I-Is Pierrot-sama mad with me-oni...?

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:51.770
To the extent that I can no longer guarantee your safety.

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:54.610
What did you say-oni?!

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:57.620
Priority number one is to stop them gathering the last Décors.

00:08:57.620 --> 00:09:02.950
I would do it myself, but I alas have other business to attend to.

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:07.690
Then let me do it-oni! I'll take those Precure down for sure this time-oni!

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:10.060
I won't let them get the last Décors-oni!

00:09:10.310 --> 00:09:12.260
I can trust you to succeed this time, then?

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:14.230
O-Of course you can!

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:18.890
Then I leave the matter in your hands.

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:24.910
If I don't defeat the Precure this time...

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:28.940
...then I'm in real big trouble-oni!

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:34.790
Happy!

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:41.780
Peace!

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:55.830
The Amazon River!

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:56.920
It's so huge!

00:09:57.410 --> 00:10:00.240
The Amazon runs through the South American continent,

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:02.900
and has the largest basin of any river on Earth.

00:10:06.070 --> 00:10:07.980
Hey! Look, there's a monkey!

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:10.260
And, there's a bird!

00:10:13.410 --> 00:10:15.270
Hey, over there!

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:18.180
Honest to god crocs!

00:10:23.550 --> 00:10:26.590
It's been a lot of fun travelling around the world today, hasn't it?

00:10:26.590 --> 00:10:27.250
Yeah!

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:29.220
It's been super great-kuru!

00:10:29.710 --> 00:10:32.190
A most unique experience, to be sure.

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:34.760
I got to take lots of photos!

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:37.800
And eat so many yummy foods!

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:41.520
Jeez, Nao, if there's one thing you love more than runnin', it's food!

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:46.150
I'd have loved to try some pirozhkis from Russia, and Spanish paella too, but...

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:48.470
I think you've eaten enough!

00:10:51.650 --> 00:10:56.350
I hate to be the bearer of bad news, but I feel we should head home sooner rather than later.

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:59.560
Alright, one more photo for the road, then!

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:01.290
Say "Peace"!

00:11:09.030 --> 00:11:10.130
It's Akaoni!

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:12.900
I've got you now, Precure-oni!

00:11:15.180 --> 00:11:18.000
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:20.840
...a Bad End-oni!

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:25.010
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness-oni!

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:42.260
The Bad Energy we gather from these animals will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, Pierrot-sama, oni!

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:49.200
We only need a few more Décors to complete the set-kuru!

00:11:49.650 --> 00:11:50.750
Oh, right!

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:53.170
Two more should be enough to complete the set!

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:59.220
I don't think so-oni! This time, I'm going to win, no matter what-oni!

00:11:59.220 --> 00:12:02.220
Come on out, Super Akanbe!

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:07.520
Super Akanbe!

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:09.460
Super!

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:14.230
I believe that's a pirahna! A type of carnivorous fish with incredibly sharp teeth!

00:12:14.490 --> 00:12:18.010
Carnivorous?! Then it's going to try and eat us!

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:21.500
Akan!

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:30.180
Super... Akanbe...

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:36.150
Super Akanbe! Tear those Precure to shreds, and take their Décors-oni!

00:12:36.550 --> 00:12:39.050
We'll see about <i>that!</i> Come on!

00:12:39.060 --> 00:12:39.850
Right!

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:44.900
Ready?

00:12:45.420 --> 00:12:48.230
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:12:48.230 --> 00:12:49.250
Go!

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:51.710
Go, go!

00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:53.300
Let's go!

00:14:20.390 --> 00:14:23.500
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:26.520
Cure Happy!

00:14:29.280 --> 00:14:31.060
Dazzling sun!

00:14:31.060 --> 00:14:33.250
Hot-blooded power!

00:14:33.980 --> 00:14:35.740
Cure Sunny!

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:41.750
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:44.750
Cure Peace!

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:50.270
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:53.270
Cure March!

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:59.250
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:02.270
Cure Beauty!

00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:06.990
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:15:12.880 --> 00:15:16.940
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:15:19.420 --> 00:15:23.580
I am not letting those Precure get the last Décors-oni!

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:25.620
Get them, Super Akanbe!

00:15:25.780 --> 00:15:27.490
Super!

00:15:28.550 --> 00:15:29.620
Akan...

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:32.710
Be!

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:38.330
Super Akan...

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:40.930
No-kuru!

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:42.700
Akan!

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:49.760
You did it-oni! Now we've got their Décors-oni!

00:15:51.850 --> 00:15:53.080
Candy!

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:20.710
That's it, Super Akanblrghblrgh-

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:23.340
Huh? Why can'd I talk proberly-oni?

00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:29.480
We can't really move freely underwater!

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:31.550
We ain't fightin' on even terms here!

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:34.320
If we could just think of some sort of counter...

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:39.780
I have to give the Precure some help...

00:16:45.760 --> 00:16:48.500
Super?!

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:02.940
I think we've turned into mermaids or somethin'!

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:09.470
And we can talk underwater now!

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:11.160
Is this using the Décors' powers?

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:15.010
I think it must be! Candy must be safe and sound after all!

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:16.540
Then we need to rescue her!

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:21.070
We're so fast now!

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:25.970
Let's set up for the Rainbow Burst!

00:17:25.970 --> 00:17:27.000
Okay!

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:28.570
Super...

00:17:30.180 --> 00:17:34.010
Akakakakakanbe!

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:35.680
Lemme handle this!

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:37.920
Precure...

00:17:37.920 --> 00:17:39.920
Sunny Fire!

00:17:43.390 --> 00:17:46.330
Aww crap! Fire ain't gonna do anythin' underwater!

00:17:46.770 --> 00:17:48.040
I can deal with him!

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:50.300
Wait, Peace, no!

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:53.030
Precure...

00:17:54.910 --> 00:17:57.350
Peace...

00:17:57.350 --> 00:17:59.070
Thunder!

00:18:09.680 --> 00:18:11.660
Super Akanbe...

00:18:11.660 --> 00:18:15.120
Peace Thunder is a little too dangerous when used underwater.

00:18:17.190 --> 00:18:18.090
My bad...

00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:22.750
Candy!

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:33.410
I kept the Décors safe-kuru!

00:18:33.410 --> 00:18:35.300
Good job, Candy!

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:39.310
Super Akanbe!

00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:43.270
We need to get to land!

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:49.220
Super!

00:18:49.220 --> 00:18:54.880
Akanbe!

00:18:57.540 --> 00:19:00.820
Super Akanbe!

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:02.260
Let's finish this!

00:19:02.260 --> 00:19:03.000
Okay!

00:19:06.470 --> 00:19:10.010
Pegasus, grant us your power!

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:26.730
Princess Happy!

00:19:26.730 --> 00:19:28.930
Princess Sunny!

00:19:28.930 --> 00:19:31.130
Princess Peace!

00:19:31.130 --> 00:19:33.330
Princess March!

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:35.530
Princess Beauty!

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:43.740
Precure: Princess Form!

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:53.510
May the light of hope shine!

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:57.000
Let it soar to a radiant future!

00:20:02.170 --> 00:20:03.880
Precure...

00:20:03.880 --> 00:20:07.330
Rainbow...

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:10.500
Burst!

00:20:14.910 --> 00:20:18.510
Akanbe...!

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:27.010
Shine, Happy Smiles!

00:20:40.310 --> 00:20:44.760
Damn you, Precure! King Pierrot's going to have my head for this-oni!

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:57.320
We did it!

00:20:57.930 --> 00:21:01.310
We got all the Décors-kuru!

00:21:01.310 --> 00:21:05.220
They managed to collect the last few Décors then, I see...

00:21:05.710 --> 00:21:08.530
Luckily, I seem to have beaten them to the punch.

00:21:08.930 --> 00:21:13.000
I have everything I need to defeat the Precure now!

00:21:16.090 --> 00:21:18.470
Finally time to revive the Royal Queen, huh?

00:21:18.870 --> 00:21:21.940
I can't wait to meet her!

00:21:22.230 --> 00:21:24.940
This means Märchenland will be safe again, right?

00:21:24.940 --> 00:21:26.080
Yup!

00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:28.510
It has been a long journey to reach this point, has it not?

00:21:28.510 --> 00:21:29.920
This is kinda exciting!

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:32.380
Alright, here goes-kuru!

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:51.700
Kuru?

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:57.040
What is this-kuru?

00:23:39.240 --> 00:23:41.770
I was so sure that this time, the Queen would actually come back.

00:23:42.240 --> 00:23:43.470
So what's this?

00:23:43.470 --> 00:23:44.510
Huh? Candy?

00:23:44.950 --> 00:23:47.910
So many sweets for me to eat-kuru...

00:23:49.040 --> 00:23:50.010
Candy has...

00:23:50.010 --> 00:23:51.180
...fallen into Joker's trap?!

00:23:51.180 --> 00:23:53.850
And what's with that black-nosed Akanbe?!

00:23:53.850 --> 00:23:55.760
Rainbow Burst ain't even scratchin' it!

00:23:55.760 --> 00:23:57.150
Candy!

00:23:57.850 --> 00:23:59.160
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.120 --> 00:24:04.460
Find your ultra happy smile!
